            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An injector device (110) for delivering a liquid medicament, comprising an injector body (111) having a proximal end (21) and a distal end (20), a syringe (115) slidably received in the injector body and moveable from a first position to a second position towards the distal end (20) of the body (111), a needle holder (116) between the syringe and the distal end (20) of the body (111), a needle (117) held in the needle holder (116) and including a distal end (117a) extending toward an opening in the distal end (20) of the body (111), and a proximal end (117b) extending toward the syringe (114), and a syringe biasing member (124) within the body (111) configured to bias the syringe (114) into the second position. The syringe (114) is spaced from the needle (117) in the first position and is in engagement with the proximal end (117b) of the needle (117) in the second position.</p>
            </abstract>
